# Code-repository hosts (git forges) for repo/namespace squatting checks.
# Columns: code  display-url  check-url
# %s is the org/user/project namespace. The check-url must return a clean,
# direct 404 for a missing namespace (the HTTP client follows redirects, so a
# soft-404 that 302-redirects to a login/landing page would false-positive).
# GitLab-based forges (gitlab.com, salsa, framagit, gnome, freedesktop),
# Bitbucket and SourceHut are intentionally omitted: unauthenticated their
# missing-namespace responses redirect to a 200 page and cannot be checked
# reliably by status code alone.
github https://github.com/%s https://api.github.com/users/%s
gitea https://gitea.com/%s https://gitea.com/api/v1/users/%s
codeberg https://codeberg.org/%s https://codeberg.org/api/v1/users/%s
gitee https://gitee.com/%s https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/%s
launchpad https://launchpad.net/~%s https://api.launchpad.net/1.0/~%s
sourceforge https://sourceforge.net/projects/%s https://sourceforge.net/rest/p/%s
pagure https://pagure.io/%s https://pagure.io/api/0/user/%s
notabug https://notabug.org/%s https://notabug.org/%s
savannah https://savannah.gnu.org/users/%s https://savannah.gnu.org/users/%s
